TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells, 10 shifts, cation exchange

SOLUTION 1  Initial solution (cell 1)
    pH     7.0
    Ca     1.0
    Cl     2.0

SOLUTION 2-10
    pH     7.0
    Ca     1.0
    Cl     2.0

SOLUTION 0  Influent solution
    pH     7.0
    Na     1.0
    Cl     1.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001

EQUILIBRATE 1-10 with solution 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells              10
    -shifts             10
    -flow_direction     forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths            1
    -dispersivities     0
    -correct_disp       false
    -time_step          1
    -punch_frequency    1
    -print_frequency    1
    -initial_time       0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -file selected.out

USER_PUNCH
    -headings Shift Cell Na_molal
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, CELL_NO, TOT("Na")

END
